3. PRIVACY & DATA SECURITY POLICY:
   - 100% Local Execution: ClaudeRotate processes all handover summaries directly
     within your browser environment and your configured LLM API endpoints.
   - NO Telemetry / Data Collection: This extension DOES NOT collect, store, or
     transmit any user data, chat history, prompt content, or API keys to any
     external tracking server or remote database.
   - Secure Local Storage: API keys are stored exclusively in Chrome local storage
     (`chrome.storage.local`) on your machine and are never exposed to web pages.

